        en: { name: 'Old Al Hamra', description: 'An old quarter of mud-brick houses and narrow lanes at the foot of the Al Hajar mountains, still partly inhabited. The nearby house-museum Bait Al Safa shows traditional Omani life.', tip: 'Walk the lanes in the morning before the heat and place a person by a mud wall or arch for the play of light. Respect residents and do not photograph people without asking; it is about 30 minutes from Nizwa.' },
